# Org feature CRUD pattern

Mirror `container/org/roomType` + `components/org/roomType`.

## Container

- `*Apis.ts`: list, search, add, update, delete via `endPoints`
- `Hooks.ts`: load list, debounced search (~350ms), create/edit dialog, delete confirm, toast + `SuccessMessage`
- `types.ts`: row + form + payload
- `index.tsx`: wire hook → view

## Components

- `index.tsx`: PageShell / PageHeader / PageSection
- `*Toolbar.tsx`: search + refresh + add
- `*Table.tsx`: responsive table, loading skeletons, empty state, edit/delete actions
- `*FormDialog.tsx`: RHF fields; `SwitchField` status on edit when API supports it
- `*DeleteDialog.tsx`: confirm soft/hard delete per API docs

## Data

- Rows only from API `data[]` — never demo seed rows
- Success: `Error_Code === 0` (or documented Success message)
- FK dropdowns: load master list from related `*Apis` (e.g. `getRoomTypeListAPI`)

## Routes

Org paths match API menus (`/org/room-type`, `/org/menu-category`, …). Unbuilt routes stay on catch-all Coming Soon.
